00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:04.630 align:start position:0%
today marks eight years since a tragic  day here in the valley officers igor  soldo and alan beck were ambushed and  killed by an anti-government couple  while they were eating lunch the two  shooters that opened fire in a nearby  walmart and killed joseph wilcox who  tried to stop them the couple later took  their own lives during a standoff with  police there was a park named in memory  of officer beck in the northwest part of  town and a number of different  scholarship opportunities in their honor  throughout the year offered to young  people
 

